        "<b>Effect measures</b>: <span class='formula'>ARR = CER − EER</span> (control event rate minus experimental event rate). <span class='formula'>NNT = 1 ÷ ARR</span>, rounded up. NNT is the number of patients you must treat for one additional patient to benefit.",
